$('applyStandingAdjustment').onclick=()=>{const teamId=val('adjustTeam');if(!teamId)return alert('Clique em um time da lista automática ou selecione no campo Equipe.');const team=teamById(teamId);const entry={id:Date.now(),teamId,teamName:team.name,competitionId:val('standingCompetition'),phase:val('adjustPhase').trim(),group:val('adjustGroup').trim().toLowerCase(),points:Number(val('adjustPoints'))||0,played:Number(val('adjustPlayed'))||0,wins:Number(val('adjustWins'))||0,draws:Number(val('adjustDraws'))||0,losses:Number(val('adjustLosses'))||0,gf:Number(val('adjustGF'))||0,ga:Number(val('adjustGA'))||0,gd:Number(val('adjustGD'))||0,percent:Number(val('adjustPercent'))||0,reason:val('adjustReason'),createdAt:new Date().toISOString()};if(!['points','played','wins','draws','losses','gf','ga','gd','percent'].some(k=>entry[k]!==0))return alert('Informe pelo menos um valor para ajustar.');const a=[...(state.standings?.adjustments||[]),entry],audit=[...(state.standings?.audit||[]),{id:Date.now()+1,action:'Ajuste aplicado',teamName:team.name,reason:entry.reason,at:new Date().toISOString(),snapshot:entry}];patch({standings:{...state.standings,adjustments:a,audit}});['adjustPoints','adjustPlayed','adjustWins','adjustDraws','adjustLosses','adjustGF','adjustGA','adjustGD','adjustPercent','adjustReason','adjustPhase','adjustGroup'].forEach(id=>$(id).value=0);};

// GRUPO 7: gerenciamento de rodadas e montagem de fases eliminatórias.
function renderGroup7(){
 const comps=state?.competitions||[], teams=state?.teams||[], rounds=state?.rounds||[], phases=state?.phaseConfigs||[];
 ['g7RoundCompetition','g7PhaseCompetition'].forEach(id=>{const el=$(id);if(!el)return;const keep=el.value;el.innerHTML=comps.map(c=>`<option value="${esc(c.id)}">${esc(c.name)} ${esc(c.season||'')}</option>`).join('');if(comps.some(c=>String(c.id)===String(keep)))el.value=keep;});
 const selectedComp=val('g7PhaseCompetition')||val('g7RoundCompetition');
 const q=$('g7QualifiedTeams');if(q){const keep=[...q.selectedOptions].map(o=>o.value);q.innerHTML=teams.filter(t=>t.active!==false&&(!selectedComp||String(t.competitionId)===String(selectedComp))).map(t=>`<option value="${esc(t.id)}">${esc(t.name)}${t.group?' — Grupo '+esc(t.group):''}</option>`).join('');[...q.options].forEach(o=>o.selected=keep.includes(o.value));}
 const compFilter=val('g7RoundCompetition');$('g7RoundsList').innerHTML=rounds.filter(r=>!compFilter||String(r.competitionId)===String(compFilter)).map(r=>`<div class="g7-round-row"><span><b>${esc(r.name)}</b><small>${esc(comps.find(c=>String(c.id)===String(r.competitionId))?.name||'Competição')} • ${esc(r.phase||'')} • Grupo ${esc(r.group||'—')} • ${esc(r.date||'')} • ${esc(({scheduled:'Não iniciada',live:'Em andamento',finished:'Encerrada'})[r.status]||r.status||'Não iniciada')}</small></span><span><button class="mini" data-g7-round-edit="${r.id}">Editar</button> <button class="mini danger" data-g7-round-del="${r.id}">Excluir</button></span></div>`).join('')||'<p class="hint">Nenhuma rodada cadastrada.</p>';
 $('g7PhaseList').innerHTML=phases.filter(p=>!selectedComp||String(p.competitionId)===String(selectedComp)).map(p=>`<div class="g7-phase-row"><span><b>${esc(p.name)}</b><small>${esc(comps.find(c=>String(c.id)===String(p.competitionId))?.name||'Competição')} • ${esc(p.round||'')} • ${Number(p.fixtureCount)||0} confronto(s) criado(s)</small></span><span>${esc(p.format==='home_away'?'Ida e volta':'Jogo único')}</span></div>`).join('')||'<p class="hint">Nenhuma fase gerada por este módulo.</p>';
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-g7-round-del]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Excluir somente o cadastro desta rodada? As partidas não serão apagadas.'))patch({rounds:rounds.filter(r=>String(r.id)!==b.dataset.g7RoundDel)})});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-g7-round-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const r=rounds.find(x=>String(x.id)===b.dataset.g7RoundEdit);if(!r)return;$('g7RoundCompetition').value=r.competitionId;$('g7RoundName').value=r.name;$('g7RoundDate').value=r.date||'';$('g7RoundPhase').value=r.phase||'';$('g7RoundGroup').value=r.group||'';$('g7RoundStatus').value=r.status||'scheduled';$('g7SaveRound').dataset.editId=r.id;$('g7SaveRound').textContent='Salvar alterações da rodada';});
}
$('g7SaveRound').onclick=()=>{const competitionId=val('g7RoundCompetition'),name=val('g7RoundName').trim();if(!competitionId||!name)return alert('Selecione a competição e informe o nome da rodada.');const list=structuredClone(state.rounds||[]),id=$('g7SaveRound').dataset.editId,existing=id?list.find(x=>String(x.id)===String(id)):null;const obj={competitionId,name,date:val('g7RoundDate'),phase:val('g7RoundPhase'),group:val('g7RoundGroup').trim().toUpperCase(),status:val('g7RoundStatus')};if(existing)Object.assign(existing,obj);else list.push({id:Date.now(),...obj,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()});delete $('g7SaveRound').dataset.editId;$('g7SaveRound').textContent='Cadastrar rodada';patch({rounds:list});$('g7RoundName').value='';};
$('g7GeneratePhase').onclick=()=>{const competitionId=val('g7PhaseCompetition'),name=val('g7NextPhase').trim(),ids=[...$('g7QualifiedTeams').selectedOptions].map(o=>o.value);if(!competitionId||!name)return alert('Selecione a competição e informe o nome da fase.');if(ids.length<2)return alert('Selecione pelo menos duas equipes classificadas.');if(ids.length%2!==0)return alert('Para gerar confrontos diretos, selecione uma quantidade par de equipes.');const teams=state.teams||[],fixtures=structuredClone(state.fixtures||[]),format=val('g7PhaseFormat'),round=val('g7NextRound')||'Jogo único';let created=0;for(let i=0;i<ids.length;i+=2){const home=teams.find(t=>String(t.id)===String(ids[i])),away=teams.find(t=>String(t.id)===String(ids[i+1]));if(!home||!away)continue;const base={competitionId,phase:name,round,group:val('g7NextGroup').trim().toUpperCase(),homeId:home.id,awayId:away.id,date:val('g7NextDate'),time:val('g7NextTime'),venue:val('g7NextVenue'),homeScore:0,awayScore:0,status:'scheduled',note:'Confronto gerado pelo módulo de classificatórias',createdAt:new Date().toISOString()};fixtures.push({id:Date.now()+created*2,...base});created++;if(format==='home_away'){fixtures.push({id:Date.now()+created*2+1,...base,homeId:away.id,awayId:home.id,round:round+' — Volta'});created++;}}const phaseConfigs=[...(state.phaseConfigs||[]),{id:Date.now(),competitionId,name,round,format,fixtureCount:created,qualifiedTeamIds:ids,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()}];patch({fixtures,phaseConfigs});alert(`${created} partida(s) criada(s). Confira a lista de jogos antes de transmitir.`);};
$('g7RoundCompetition').onchange=renderGroup7;$('g7PhaseCompetition').onchange=renderGroup7;

setInterval(()=>{if(state){let sec=state.clock.seconds;if(state.clock.running&&state.clock.startedAt)sec+=Math.floor((Date.now()-state.clock.startedAt)/1000);$('clock').textContent=fmt(sec)}},500);

